---
description: enhanced_change_notifier usage context
globs: **/*.dart
alwaysApply: false
---

Prefer `EnhancedChangeNotifier` when code needs `target`, `once`, or `immediate` listener behavior. Use `this["property"] = value` for notifying updates, `fromMap` for silent state replacement, and `notifyListeners("property")` for manual targeted notification. Use `Signal` and `EnhancedLatchNotifier` for deferred notification flows.
